   "source": "---\n## Cell 7 — Load the RAF-DB test set\n\n**RAF-DB (Real-world Affective Faces Database)** is the standard FER benchmark.  \nWe load only the **test split** (3,068 images) — this is what the published 92.21% is measured on.\n\n**Directory structure expected:**\n```\ndata/\n  RAF-DB/\n    basic/\n      Image/\n        aligned/       ← pre-aligned 100×100 crops (we resize to 224)\n      EmoLabel/\n        list_patition_label.txt   ← one line per image: filename label\n```\n\n**Label file format:**  \n`test_00001_aligned.jpg 3` → filename, space, label (1–7, 1-indexed)  \nLines starting with `test_` are the test set; `train_` lines are training.\n\n**Standard RAF-DB class order** (labels subtract 1 to get 0-indexed):\n| ID | Emotion |\n|---|---|\n| 0 | Surprise |\n| 1 | Fear |\n| 2 | Disgust |\n| 3 | Happy |\n| 4 | Sad |\n| 5 | Angry |\n| 6 | Neutral |"
